  .github/workflows/release.yml for how the workflow submits the compiled installer for signing
  under this configuration.

  Note: this configuration cannot cover the installer's embedded uninstaller (unins000.exe) -
  see "Uninstaller signing limitation" in docs/CODE_SIGNING_POLICY.md.

  Schema reference: https://docs.signpath.io/artifact-configuration/reference
-->
